<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh November oil output rises to 2.04 mln tonne.</title>
<headline>Kazakh November oil output rises to 2.04 mln tonne.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's production of crude oil and gas condensate rose to 2.04 million tonnes in November from 1.88 million in October, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following figures for crude, natural gas and oil products output in its latest monthly statistical review:</p>
<p>  KAZAKH ENERGY OUTPUT	NOV 96	 OCT 96   JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>  Crude oil (million tonnes) 2.036	 1.879     20.598</p>
<p>   mth/mth pct change	 +8.3	  -5.8	  n/a</p>
<p>   yr/yr   pct change	+11.6	  +2.0	+11.0</p>
<p>Natural gas</p>
<p>    (billion cubic metres)   0.59	  0.52	 5.7</p>
<p>   mth/mth pct change	 +15.3	 -2.8	  n/a</p>
<p>   yr/yr   pct change	 +5.0	  -5.4	 +6.7</p>
<p>  Gasoline (tonnes)	   168,500     112,800 2,131,800</p>
<p>   mth/mth pct change	 +49.4	 -51.6	  n/a</p>
<p>   yr/yr   pct change	 -22.44	-36.6	 +9.0</p>
<p>  Diesel (tonnes)	     250,700     239,000  3,110,900</p>
<p>   mth/mth pct change	 +4.9	  -35.1	  n/a</p>
<p>   yr/yr   pct change	 -1.3	  -14.7	 +3.6</p>
<p>  Fuel oil (tonnes)	   324,300     336,000  3,433,000</p>
<p>   mth/mth pct change	 -3.5	  -10.1	  n/a</p>
<p>   yr/yr   pct change	 +37.6	 +0.2	  +6.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Comparative data for January-November '95 was not available.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
